        <briefdescription>
<para>Assemble context chunks within the token budget. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Deterministically selects a subset of <computeroutput>chunks</computeroutput> that fit within the context window while reserving tokens for the model&apos;s response.</para>
<sect1 id="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_r_a_g_context_assembler_1autotoc_md8_1s1"><sect2 id="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_r_a_g_context_assembler_1autotoc_md8">
<title>Algorithm</title><para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Compute ContextWindowBudget from config + system_prompt + query.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Sort <computeroutput>chunks</computeroutput> by relevance_score descending with deterministic tie-breaking (chunk_id, source, content).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Greedily fill the available token budget in sorted order.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Optionally truncate the last over-budget chunk if config_.allow_partial_chunk is true.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
<sect1 id="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_r_a_g_context_assembler_1autotoc_md9_1s1"><sect2 id="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_r_a_g_context_assembler_1autotoc_md9">
<title>Complexity</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>Time</bold>: O(n log n) where n = chunks.size()</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Space</bold>: O(n) for result.chunks_used</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>chunks</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Candidate retrieved chunks (may be empty). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>system_prompt</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>System / instruction prompt (used for budget calculation). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>query</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>User query (used for budget calculation).</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1_assembled_context" kindref="compound">AssembledContext</ref> with:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>chunks_used: selected chunks in relevance order</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>tokens_used: estimated token count of assembled context</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>tokens_remaining_for_response: guaranteed response budget</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>was_truncated: true if the last chunk was truncated to fit</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="pre"><para>config_.model_context_tokens &gt; 0 (or defaults to kDefaultContextWindowTokens) </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="pre"><para>config_.min_response_tokens &gt;= 0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="pre"><para>chunks.empty() is valid; returns valid empty context</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="post"><para>result.tokens_remaining_for_response &gt;= min_response_tokens </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="post"><para>result.tokens_remaining_for_response &gt;= 20% of model_context_tokens </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="post"><para>result.tokens_used + result.tokens_remaining_for_response &lt;= model_context_tokens </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="post"><para>result.chunks_used is sorted by relevance descending</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Thread-safe: no concurrent mutation of config_ during call </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Fail-closed: empty input or zero budget returns valid empty context </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
