    <sectiondef kind="public-static-func">
      <memberdef kind="function" id="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_r_a_g_context_assembler_1a20532b4271fe1f1b61518eab7331193e" prot="public" static="yes" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>int</type>
        <definition>int themis::rag::RAGContextAssembler::computeMaxTokens</definition>
        <argsstring>(const ContextWindowBudget &amp;budget, int user_max=0)</argsstring>
        <name>computeMaxTokens</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::rag::RAGContextAssembler::computeMaxTokens</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const ContextWindowBudget &amp;</type>
          <declname>budget</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>int</type>
          <declname>user_max</declname>
          <defval>0</defval>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Compute the recommended InferenceRequest::max_tokens value. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Compute Max Tokens.</para>
<para>Ensures the model cannot be asked to generate more tokens than the context window can hold after the prompt is filled. This guards against token budget exhaustion during generation.</para>
<sect1 id="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_r_a_g_context_assembler_1autotoc_md10_1s1"><sect2 id="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_r_a_g_context_assembler_1autotoc_md10">
<title>Calculation</title><para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Calculate available_response_tokens = budget.reserved_response_tokens</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>If <computeroutput>user_max</computeroutput> &gt; 0: clamp to min(user_max, available_response_tokens)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Otherwise: use available_response_tokens</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Ensure result &gt;= 1 (model must be able to generate at least one token)</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>budget</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Pre-computed ContextWindowBudget for the request (from ContextWindowBudget::compute(context_window,
                                              system_prompt, query,
                                              min_response_tokens)). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>user_max</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Caller-supplied cap. If 0: unconstrained by caller. If &gt;0: result is min(user_max, available_response).</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Recommended max_tokens value for InferenceRequest. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="post"><para>return value &gt;= 1 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="post"><para>return value &lt;= budget.reserved_response_tokens </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="post"><para>if user_max &gt; 0: return value &lt;= user_max</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Thread-safe: stateless function </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Complexity: O(1)</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">budget</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">user_max</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Return value. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
